# Elemental Teachings {4}{G}: Bot1 (Black Lotus for GGG, Mox Emerald and Mox Pearl) searches for up to four land cards with different names:
# a second Forest or Island (same name), a fifth land (Plains) and a nonland card (Llanowar Elves) are refused (CR 701.23, 201.2b). It finds
# Forest, Island, Mountain and Swamp and reveals them; Bot2 chooses two, Island and Swamp, which go to Bot1's graveyard, and the other
# two, Forest and Mountain, enter tapped under Bot1's control (CR 608.2d, 701.20a). Bot2's own library, with lands of the same names, is
# not searched and keeps its 15 cards (22 less the 7 drawn), and Bot1's library, shuffled, has the 11 left.

